id=rosemary_vowifi_fix
name=Rosemary MediaTek VoWiFi & WOD Fix
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=SumantaMajumdar
description=Restores Wi-Fi Calling (VoWiFi) on user and userdebug custom ROMs for Redmi Note 10S (rosemary / MT6785). Restores epdg_wod, libwo.so, mtkimsprobe, MediaTek IMS properties, and persistent CarrierConfig overrides.
